WHY THIS COURSE EXISTS
The market is real. The bar is high. The gap is closable.
UK finance salaries have risen 28–34% since 2020. Compliance roles 
take four months or more to fill. SMEs cannot afford a £55,000 London 
analyst — but they will pay well for a credentialled professional who 
works their hours, writes clearly, and delivers without supervision.
That professional is not defined by geography. It is defined by 
readiness. This course closes the readiness gap in three specific areas: 
employability skills, global work culture and time discipline, and the AI 
tools that global teams now expect you to use.
