LEARNING OUTCOMES
By the end of Day 3, every learner can:
Present a verified profile
A two-page international CV, an employer-facing LinkedIn, and proof of 
credentials (ICAN, ACCA, ACAMS, certifications) ready for vetting.
Write and speak for global teams
Clear, direct, low-context English — in email, Slack, and on camera — without 
the habits that mark a candidate as untested.
Operate inside global work culture
Ownership, documentation, honest status updates, and asking early — the 
behaviours UK and US managers actually reward.
Master time zones and the remote day
Convert WAT to any client zone instantly, protect overlap hours, and hand work 
across zones without dropping it.
Use AI tools to deliver faster, safely
Draft, summarise, analyse, and check work with AI — while protecting client 
data and keeping human judgement central.
Pass vetting and the interview
Know Deeptalent's assessment stages, prepare STAR answers, run a professional 
video setup, and spot job scams.
