30 min
MODULE 1.1
The global remote market: where a corps member fits
Who hires, and for what
•SMEs in the UK, US, Canada, and Australia — 10 to 200 staff, no offshore HR, 
one to three roles at a time.
•Finance & accounting: bookkeeping, AP/AR, FP&A, credit risk, audit support.
•Compliance: KYC/AML analysts, onboarding, transaction monitoring.
•Technology & data: full-stack, cloud/DevOps, BI dashboards, automation.
•Customer experience and executive operations: support, CRM, calendar and 
project coordination.
WHAT THE SCREEN ACTUALLY TESTS
01
Credentials that can be verified
ICAN, ACCA, ACAMS, CFA levels, cloud and data certifications — with membership 
numbers.
02
Evidence, not adjectives
Numbers: reconciled 1,200 transactions monthly; cut close time from 9 to 5 days.
03
Written English under time pressure
A 10-minute written task reveals more than an hour of talking.
04
Reliability signals
Do you reply within a working day? Do you show up on time to a 15-minute call?
05
Work readiness
Power, internet, quiet space, a laptop that works — and a plan B for each.
Deeptalent places professionals into fully managed roles — contracting, compliance, and 
payroll are handled for you. Your job is to be the person the client would never want to 
replace.
