THE PROMPT FORMULA
Role
"You are a UK management accountant."
Context
"This is a variance report for a 40-person 
SaaS firm."
Task
"Summarise the five largest variances."
Format
"A table, then three bullet points, under 
150 words."
Check
"Flag anything you are unsure of."
Then verify every number, name, and citation yourself. AI 
drafts; you sign.
Get Global Workforce Ready  ·  NYSC Corps Member Pathway16

30 min
MODULE 3.2
AI in your function — and the rules that keep you employed
Finance & accounting
Build and explain formulas, draft month-end commentary, 
spot anomalies in a ledger export, convert bank 
statements to structured data — then reconcile by hand.
Compliance & KYC/AML
Summarise regulatory updates, draft policy language, 
structure case notes, prepare screening questions. Never 
paste customer PII into a public tool.
Technology & data
Copilot-style code completion, test generation, 
documentation, SQL drafting, dashboard narrative. Review 
every line as if a junior wrote it.
CX & operations
Reply drafts in the client's tone, ticket categorisation, 
meeting minutes, SOP writing, calendar triage. Keep the 
human warmth; strip the AI blandness.
FIVE NON-NEGOTIABLES
1
Client data never enters a tool the client has not 
approved. Ask in writing.
2
Verify before you send. You own the error, not the 
model.
3
Disclose when asked, and when it matters (e.g. 
drafted with AI, reviewed by me).
4
Keep the skill. Use AI to go faster at things you can 
already do by hand.
5
Human judgement stays central — that is 
Deeptalent's standard and your value.
