MODULE 3.3
Vetting, interviews and offers: the last mile
Deeptalent vetting: what happens after you click 'I'm Global Workforce Ready'
01  Apply
Short form: experience, 
credentials, availability, 
preferences.
02  Verify
Identity, qualifications, 
references, and 
work-readiness checks.
03  Assess
Written task and a structured 
interview in your specialism.
04  Match
Shortlisted against live client 
briefs by credentials, not 
keywords.
05  Client interview
We brief you, coordinate, and 
debrief.
06  Deploy
Contracting, onboarding and 
payroll handled. 14–21 days 
end to end.
Video interview setup
•Camera at eye level, face lit from the front, plain 
background.
•Wired earphones with a mic; test 10 minutes before.
•Join 3 minutes early; phone on silent; backup hotspot ready.
•Dress as you would for a bank interview in Lagos.
Answer with STAR
•Situation · Task · Action · Result — 90 seconds each.
•Prepare six stories: a deadline, a mistake, a conflict, a 
process you improved, a tool you learned, a time you said 
no.
•End every answer with the number or the outcome.
•Ask two questions about how the team works, not about 
salary — ranges are already published.
Scam red flags
•Anyone asking you to pay for a job, training 'to secure' a 
role, or equipment upfront.
•Offers without an interview; pressure to act today.
•Pay in crypto or via a personal account; requests for your 
BVN or passport before an offer.
•Deeptalent never charges professionals to be placed.
