MODULE 3.4 · CAPSTONE
Readiness check: prove all six outcomes in one submission
The submission (one PDF, due 48 hours after the live session)
1
Profile
Final two-page CV + LinkedIn URL + credentials index (Outcome 1).
2
Communication
A 120-word email to a UK manager reporting a slipping deadline, with a revised 
plan (Outcomes 2 & 3).
3
Time zones
Your Day 2 weekly plan, corrected, with a screenshot of your two-zone calendar 
(Outcome 4).
4
AI task
A one-page summary of a 5-page document produced with AI, with your own 
verification notes and the prompt used (Outcome 5).
5
Interview
A 90-second recorded STAR answer to: 'Tell me about a time you delivered under 
pressure.' (Outcome 6).
HOW IT IS SCORED
70%
pass mark across the five parts, each marked against the 
module rubric. No part may score zero.
•Pass: you are invited straight into Deeptalent vetting via 
'I'm Global Workforce Ready'.
•Near miss: one resubmission within seven days, with 
written feedback.
•Certificate of completion issued on pass; verifiable by 
reference number.
